You consume all Miasma Engine stacks you have to fire a blast of corrosive death through your steamgun, dealing [135%, 150%, 161%, 171%, 180% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as acid in a radius 1 cone with a [16%, 39%, 52%, 61%, 68% (TL1-5)] chance to remove a random beneficial physical or mental effect. For every stack beyond the first the damage dealt is increased by 50% and there is a [16%, 39%, 52%, 61%, 68% (TL1-5)] chance to remove an additional effect.

This attack ignores all enemy armour, and you must have at least 1 stack of Miasma Engine to use this talent.
